<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Colossaete</book>
  <para style="h">Colossaete</para>
  <para style="toc1">Colossaete</para>
  <para style="toc2">Colossaete</para>
  <para style="mt">Colossaete</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii deina taw Jesus Christ ii sawltak khat ahi Paul le ih suapuipa Timothy in —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Colossae khua ah a om Christ taw pumkhat ahi a thumaan suapui le Pathian mite tungah lai kong thaak uh hi. Ih Pa Pathian in thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />No atu thu ka nget uh ciangin, ih Topa Jesus ii Pa ahi Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Jesus Christ na upna uh le Pathian ii mite theampo na itna uh ka za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungdamna Thupha a maan thuhilna no tungah hong theng masa a, tua ii hong piak tu lametna sia na za zo uh hi. Tua ahikomin vantung ah no atu in hong kikoisak na lamet uh sia ii tungah na upna le na itna uh, kingaa in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian ii thuthiamna na zaak phit ni uh pan kipan, no in a maan tatakin na heak uh bangma, tua lungdamna thu in, thuphate no tungah hong puapuak a, leitung theampo ah kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian ii thuthiamna sia kote taangin Christ ii thumaan naseampa ka nasep pui Epaphras tung panin heakna na nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Thaa ii hong piak itna na neina uh ko tungah hong son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua thu hangin note thu ka zaak pan kipan thu kong ngetsak tawntung uh hi. Ama deina tel theina le a Thaa ii hong piak ciimna le heakna theampo taw note hong kidimsak natu in Pathian tungah ka ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa deina bangin na nungta thei tu uh a, ama ii diksak bangin na vawt tawntung tu uh hi. Na nuntakna in nasep pha theampo piangsak tu a, Pathian heakna sungah na khangto tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na theampo thinsauna taw na thuak zawk natu uh in, ama ii minthang vaangletna in note hong thahatsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thinnopna taw Pa tungah lungdam na ko tavun. A ma in khuavakna ngam sungah a mite ii lua tu a khealsiate nga tu in hong kilawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in khuazing vaangletna sung pan eite hong hun a, a it a Tapa ngam sungah bit takin hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A chisan hangin eite ih suakta a, ih mawnate hong kimaisak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Christ sia mu thei ngawl Pathian ii pianzia muna ahi hi. Ama sia bitphua sa theampo sung pan Tapa upabel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile vantung leitung na theampo, a kimu thei le a kimu maw nate thaa taw kisai vaangletna neite, tote, a ukte le thuneite theampo sia ama tungtawnin Pathian in bitphua hi. Pathian in ama tungtawnin vaannuai buppi ama atu in bitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Christ sia tuate theampo om ma in om a, ama taw kikopin a omna mun tu tek ah om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a pumpi ahi pawlpi lutang hi a, ama in pumpi ii nuntakna naak ahi hi. Ama in Tapa upabel hi a, na theampo sungah ama bek a masa phitbel ahi natu in thina panin tho kiksak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian ii khensatna om bangin Tapa in Pathian ii zia theampo nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaciang Tapa tungtawnin Pathian in vaannuai buppi sia ama kung a thet kik thei natu in khensat hi. Thinglamtee tungah a kibua Tapa ii chisan tungtawnin Pathian in kilemna piangsak a, leitung vantung ah a om, na theampo ama kungah then kik siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hun khat lai in note in Pathian taw na kikhuala uh a, ngitlo ngamtatna le ngitlo khua ngaisutna na nei uh manin a ngalte na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang tu in ama omna munah a thiangtho, a kidoituam, a sitbaang ngawlin hong thet thei natu in a Tapa ii pumpi thina hangin Pathian in a lawmte hong suaksak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kho thu doppha tungah na thumaan tawntung vun a, lungdamna thu na zaak ciil uh lai a na nga uh lametna taw na kipeal nuam heak vun. Leitung mihing sim tungah a kihil hi lungdamna thu hu in keima Paul sia naseam khat suak ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu in no atu ka thuak nate tungtaang ah ka lungdam hi, banghang ziam cile a pumpi ahi pawlpi atu Christ ii thuak tu a om laite a khuangkhim natu in keima in cii le sa taw ka thuak ciangin a hu ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciangin kei sia Pawlpi naseam tu in Pathian in hong vawt hi a, note phat natu in hi nasep lian sia sep tu in hong kipia hi. Tua nasep lian sia ama thu a cing takin thansak natu hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tua thu in hun bosa sungah mihing nam theampo te sung pan a kiseal, tuciangin ama mite tungah a kilak thuku ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian ii ngealna sia ama ii thuku, mihing theampo atu in, ama ii a nei a tuanngen thuku sia a mite ii a heaksak tu ahi hi. Tua thuku in bangziam cile Christ in note sungah om a tua hu in note in Pathian ii vaangletna na lua tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom Christ sia mihing khat sim tungah ka hil uh hi. Pathian omna munah mihing khat simin Christ taw kikop in, a khanthin natu in ciimna theampo taw hil in a kidop natu thu ka pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi nasep a kizaw thei natu in ka sungah na hong seam Christ ii nasia tak a tha hong piakna zanghin diangin ka kisaan hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei akua ci hong he ngawl midangte le Laodicea a om mihingte le note atu in bangzata haksa in naseam khi ziam ci sia kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi bang ka ngamtat sia amate thinletna taw a kidim natu, ki itna sungah a kikaizot natu, le thumaan heakna pan a piang thinmuanna a kicing hauna a nei thei natu deina ahi hi. Hisia lam panin Pathian thuku ahi Christ ama mama sia amate in he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ciimna le heakna a kiphualseal sumngum theampo a kihonna tawtang sia ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom kong son hi, bangza po in pha tu bang ahitazong, kinialna maan ngawlte taw kuama in na theamsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ka pumpi taw hong omkhawm ngawl ka hihang ka thinsung taw note kungah kong om hi, tuaciangin Christ ih upna sungah kip takin na din khopna uh ka mu ciangin ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesus Christ sia Topa a na saan zawk uh nungsang, ama taw kikopin nungta tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama sungah zung thuk tha vun a, ama tungah na nuntakna uh sa to tavun, tuaciangin hong kihil sa bangin na upna sungah hat seseam vun. Lungdamkona taw na kidim tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom Christ sung pan ahi ngawl, vaannuai a uk thaa te ii mihingte tungah a piak susuk a mannung ngawl kitheamna, mihing ciimnate taw kuama in sila a hong mat ngawl natu in kikeam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile thaa pianzia sia Christ le ama ii mihing a hina sung mama ah a cing takin teang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciangin ama taw na kikopna uh sungah a kicing nuntakna hong pia zo hi. Ama sia thaa lam sangah a ukte le thuneite khat sim sangin lianzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesus taw kikopna sungah note vunteap at sa na hi uh a, mihing vunteap atzia taw hi ngawlin, hi mawna pumpi thahatna pan hong suatak Christ vunteap atzia taw hong ki at zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cinopna in na ki baptize uh ciang Christ taw a kivui sa na hi zo uh a, na ki baptize na in thina pan a thokiksak Pathian ii vaangletna sungah na upna tungtawnin note zongh Christ taw hong kitho kik khawmsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hun khat lai in, na mawna uh hang le Thukham nei ngawl Gentile te na hi uh hangin note sia thaa lam ah a thisa na hi uh hi. Ahitazong tu in Pathian in Christ taw nuntakna sungah hong then zo hi. Pathian in ih mawna theampo hong maisak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in eite hong heencip ahi thusia tepteena leiba theampo hong phiatsak a, thinglamtee tungah hong kilcipsak siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciang tua thinglamtee tungah Christ in thaa lam sangah ukna neite le thuneite ii vaangletna pan ama le ama kisuaktasak hi; tuate sia ama ngalzaw poai sungah sila tu in a kimante bangin mihonte ii mu tu in kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom neak le dawn huvau ahizong, a thiangtho nite huvau ahizong, Thadet poai le Sabbath nipi huvau ahizong note tungah zui tu ngeina vawtsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabangte theampo sia maisang a hong pai pheang tu nate ii limh ahi hi; a tatak sia Christ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vawttawm kiniamkhiakna le vantunglalangte bia in hong sawl a, mukhol thei tuam a neina hangin thupi a kisate ii hong puavawk tu sia noma le noma na ki oai heak vun. Bangma thu om ngawl bulin tuabang mihingte sia a mihing khua ngaisutna taw kisuangtaak uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang pumpi lutang ahi Christ thasua uh hi. Christ ukna nuai ah pumpi bup kipuua to a, a ngu le a sapiatte in a om natu san tek len in Pathian dei bangin khangto uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note Christ taw thi khawm zo a, vaannuai a uk thaa te panin hong kisuaktasak zo hi. Tua ahile banghangin hi leitung ii neisa bangin nungta nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hisia tham heak in, tuasia tep heak in, a dang sia thutha heak in,” ci bang thukhamte banghangin ni nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hite in khatvei a kizak zawkciang, kimanna a nei nawn ngawl thute a cina hi; tuate in mihing vawttawm ngeinate le hilnate hi bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuabang ngeinate sia ciimna bulphu in a piang hi tuak a, vantunglalangte biak tu sawl ngawpna sung, vawttawm kiniamkhiakna sung le pumpi nasia tak a ngim piakna sungah kizangh hi; ahihang tuate in pumpi deinate ukna tu in bangma man nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Note nuntakna sungah Christ taw hong kithosak kik zo ahikom Pathian ii ziatsang kumpi tokhum tung Christ tona mun vantung ah a om nate thangai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah na ngaisutna uh phut vun a, hi leitung ah phut heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile note thi zo a, tuaciang na nuntakna uh sia Pathian sungah Christ taw kiseal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na nuntakna tatak uh sia Christ hi a, tuaciang ama hong kilangh ciangin note zongh ama taw na kilangh khawm tu uh a, ama ii vaangletna na siim tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note in na sungah na hong seam leitung deinate na thisak uh kul tu hi, tuate sia numei le pa khialna, kiihuai ngamtatna, cii le sa deina zui nopna, ngamtat sia tatnopna, duhopna (duhopna sia milim biakna nam khat ahi hi) te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua bangte hu in ama thu a ni ngawlte ii tungah Pathian thin uukna hong tung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na nuntakna uh tuate ii hong huknelh hunlai in noma mama zongh tuabang uukna deinate taw kipawl in na nungta ngei zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang tu in note in, thin uukna, a sia thangaina, etsatna thin neina, hite theampo na vawk siat vun. Kiselnona le a kiihuai kammalte na muk uh pan pusuaksak ngei heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khat le khat na kitheam heak vun, banghang ziam cile na nuntakna lui taw a kikop zongsang nate na suut zo uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a thak nuntakna zia na silh zo uh hi. Tua in, a kicing takin ama ih heak seseam natu in, Bitphuapa Pathian ii ama a suun tu in hong thaksua tawntung nuntakna thak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hu in Gentile le Jew, vunteap at le at ngawl, khualmi le tualmi, sila le sila ahi ngawlte ci bangin kidoidanna om ngawl hi. Ahihang Christ sia na theampo hi a, na theampo sungah Christ om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note sia Pathian ii mite na hi uh hi, ama in hong it a ama atu in hong teal hi. Tua ahikom note sia kiciliapna, cikna, kiniamkhiakna, thinneamna le thinsau nate puan bangin na silh uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khat le khat na kidual vun a, a dang khat ii tungah lungkim ngawlna a nei khat po na om uh ciangin, khat le khat kimaisak vun. Topa in note mawna hong maisak bangma in note zongh khat le khat na kimaisak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciangin hi kicinna tungsia ah ki itna belap vun, tua in na theampo a cingin pumkhat suak tu in hong hencip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Christ ii thinnopna hong piak sia bang tu ziam cile na thukhensat nate sungah lam hong lak tu in, hong piak ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile hi thinnopna sungah note theampo pumkhatin a omkhawm tu, Pathian in hong sam hi. Tuaciangin lungdamko na thiam tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kicing Christ ii thu na thinsung uh ah hong teang tahen. Khat le khat ciimna theampo taw kihil kilak tavun. Psalm late, pokna late le la thiangtho te na thinsung uh ah lungdamkona in Pathian tungah na sa vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na sep, na son uh theampo hu in, Pa Pathian tungah lungdam na ko uh ciangin, Topa Jesus min taw na vawt tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zite awng, na pasalte thu ni tavun, banghang ziam cile Tapidaw na hina uh taw hi bangin na ngamtat tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasalte awng, na zite uh na it vun, amate tungah na ngongtat heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tate awng, nute pate ii thu na nit tawntung tu uh sia Tapidawte vaipuak hi a, tua in Pathian ii lungkim thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nute pate awng, na tate uh a thin na uuksak heak vun, a thin na uuksak uh le a thin kiam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Silate awng, thu theampo ah na tote thu ni vun, pha hong sak tu deina taw amate hong etcik laitak bek hi ngawlin, Topa na thasia uh hu in, thin tak taw a thu ni vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na nasep uh theampo sungah mihing atu hi ngawlin Topa atu a seam bangin kingaisunin na thin theampo taw naseam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in ama ii mite atu a khealsia thamante note hong pia tu hi ci in na phawk tavun. Banghang ziam cile na Topa tatakin Christ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciangin ngamtat khialna a nei theampo sia a khialna bangin thuak tu hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in mihing sim a kibangin thukhen tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To ahite awng, na sila te tungah dikna le thutang taw na ngamta vun. Vantung ah note zongh in Topa khat na nei uh hunlam phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu na ngen tawntung nanak vun. Thu na nget uh ciang na pilvang vun a, Pathian tungah lungdam na ko vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ko atu zongh hong ngetsak tavun, tua hile Pathian in Christ ii thukute huvau ka hil natu hunpha hong pia tu hi. Banghang ziam cile tua thu in tu laitak a, thongsung a ka omna thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua thu a thiang a, ka son tu bangin ka son thei natu in thu na ngetsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thu um ngawlte tung na ngamtatna uh ah ciimna na zangh vun a, hunpha na nga uh theampo a pha takin na zangh vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kampau na uh sia a zaak nop huai hi tu a, a lawp huai hi tawntung tu hi, tuaciangin mihing khat sim tungah a maanin na zo kik thei tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ih it ih suapuipa Tychicus, a thumaan naseampa le Topa nasepna sungah ih naseppui pa in kei huvau thupiang thakte hong son siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note kungah ama kong paisakna in tua thu hang ahi hi, kote bangbangin om ka hi uh hunlam hong son ciangin na thin uh a nop natu ka deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Onesimus a kici khat taw hong ton hi, tua pa in a thumaan suapui hi a, no pawl sungah hong kihel khat ahi hi. Amate nii in hi sungah thupiang theampo hong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei taw thong sungah a om Aristarchus in hong paupui hi, tuasia bangma Barnabas suapuisealpa Mark zongh in hong paupui hi. (Mark sia no sangah hong pai ahile vai na muak vun ci in sawlna zongh nga zo nu hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Justus zongh a kici Joshua zongh in paupuina kam hong thaak hi. Hite thum in Jew te sung pan hong kikhealte hi a Pathian ngam atu kei taw na a seam khawmte hi a, amate in nasia takin hong hute ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Epaphras zongh in hong paupui hi, ama in Jesus Christ ii naseampa khat hi a noma pawl sungah a kihel khat ahi hi. Ama in Pathian tungah note sia a khanthin le a cingtaak tak a, a thinzo Tapidawte, Pathian ii deina bang a, khuangkhim takin a zuite bangin kho takin, na din natu in nasia tatakin thu hong ngetsak tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No atu le Laodicea le Hierapolis ah a om mihingte atu in nasia takin na a seampa hi ci in keima tatak ma in tetti ka pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ih it syavuan Luke le Demas in paupuina kam hong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laodicea khua ah a om ih suapuite le Nympha le tua nu inn ah a kikhawm pawlpi tungah thupha ka deisaknate na sonsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi laithak na sim zawk uh ciangin Laodicea pawlpite zongh in na simsak hamtang vun. Laodicea khua a om ih suapuite hong puak tu lai sia zongh na sim vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciangin Archippus munah, “Topa nasepna sungah, na sep tu hong kipiate na zaw thei natu na son in,” na cisak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Paul ii hong paupuina ci in hi lai, keima khut vateak taw ma kong at hi. Koltaang ka hi hong mangil heak vun! Pathian ii thuthiamna in no taw hong om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
